{"seq":2,"slug":"dynamics-loudness","title":"动态与响度","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"compression-limiting","title":"压缩与限制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/compression-limiting","wordCount":1552,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"lufs-loudness","title":"响度标准 LUFS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/lufs-loudness","wordCount":1343,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-range-musicality","title":"动态范围与音乐性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mastering/dynamics-loudness/dynamic-range-musicality","wordCount":1450,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"动态与响度\">动态与响度</h1><p>母带最被外行误解、也最容易做错的，就是响度。这一章在母带基础（信号链、监听）的框架下，把动态处理和响度标准讲清楚，并回答一个 2026 年的核心问题：在流媒体归一化的时代，到底该追求什么。</p>\n<p>第一篇《压缩与限制》区分两种角色截然不同却同属一类的工具。总线压缩用低压缩比、慢启动负责&quot;胶合&quot;——把整首歌黏成有凝聚力的整体；限制器是压缩比趋于无穷的极端形态，负责&quot;封顶&quot;——把作品推到目标响度并守住真峰值不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> dBTP，给流媒体编码留余量。混淆两者的职责是最常见的失误。</p>\n<p>第二篇《响度标准 LUFS》讲那把衡量感知响度的尺子。LUFS 基于 ITU-R BS.1770，模拟人耳灵敏度。2026 年主流平台已收敛到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> LUFS，一份好母带通吃所有平台。更关键的是它讲清了归一化的逻辑：平台把过响的歌调低却不恢复其动态，于是&quot;做更响&quot;从竞争优势变成净亏损——响度战争就此终结。</p>\n<p>第三篇《动态范围与音乐性》接住前一篇的结论：既然响度被拉平，真正决定听感的就回到了动态本身。它区分宏观动态（段落落差）与微观动态（瞬态冲击），说明过度限制是双重损失，并强调动态保留量是风格的函数——嘻哈可以很密集，古典必须留呼吸。</p>\n<p>三篇连起来：先掌握工具（压缩/限制），再理解标准（LUFS/归一），最后回到本质（守动态、守音乐性）。这一章和下一章&quot;频谱与音色&quot;并行，共同构成母带的听觉塑形。</p>\n"}